<title>USA: Arthuis - euro will be stabilising force.</title>
<headline>Arthuis - euro will be stabilising force.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Monday the euro would be a stabilising force in the world monetary system.</p>
<p>&quot;The euro is coming soon -- on January 1, 1999 it will be a reality.  We are ready,&quot; he said in a speech at the semi-annual meeting of the International Monetary Fund and World Bank.</p>
<p>&quot;The euro will be a stabilising force in the European Union and the international monetary system,&quot; he said, according to a text of his speech.</p>
<p>He also urged the IMF to work actively on the implications of the launch of the euro for its own activities.</p>
</text>
